title: snes-mapper-python
message: >-
  If you use this work, or the header combinations it was settled against, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-mapper-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-mapper-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the cartridge memory map and the transfer engine it is reached through:
  where an address lands, what reaching it costs, and what an armed channel would move.
  Every layout is settled against the header combinations declared by a library of
  retail cartridges rather than against its author's confidence, and no cartridge, no
  title and no byte outside a header is carried anywhere in the repository.
keywords:
  - hardware-model
  - memory-map
  - cartridge
  - conformance
  - address-decoding
  - dma
